# etc/zan

# z: zh. the east. adds zan/etc/mn
#    to etc/mn and adds an almost
#    empty dir in mnt/mn with only
#    the standard '...' file.
#    mn stands for
#    1. meaning. the east writes
#       primarily with semantics,
#       at least in z.
#    2. moon. when used as a chroot,
#       the z prefix is mounted at
#       mnt/mn, a pun on mnt/sinai
#       which is possibly derived
#       from sin, the sumerian god
#       of the moon.
#
# a: an. the west, or anglosphere.
#    adds zan/etc/sn to etc/sn
zan     z a n
